Your project uses MSTest v3 (3.8.0). In MSTest v4, `Assert.IsInstanceOfType<T>(obj, out var t)` was changed to return the typed value directly instead of using an `out` parameter.

**Fix:** Change `out var` pattern to assignment:

```csharp
// Before (v3)
Assert.IsInstanceOfType<FastProcessor>(processor, out var typed);

// After (v4)
var typed = Assert.IsInstanceOfType<FastProcessor>(processor);
```

